 "fieldData": {
  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"Social Media Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is social media automation?\", \"a\": \"Social media automation is software that takes over the repeat steps of posting. It holds approved posts in a queue, sends drafts to reviewers, publishes through each network's API at the set time and collects the numbers afterward. People still decide what the brand says.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you set up automated social media posting?\", \"a\": \"Begin with a content calendar where every post is one row and every row has a status. Then describe in plain sentences who approves which posts, and connect each account through its official API. Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder'>AI automation builder</a> builds the app from that description. Point it at a test account for its first week.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is the best tool to automate social media?\", \"a\": \"The best social media automation tools depend on where your posting stalls. A scheduler is enough if the only gap is time slots. When the team needs its own review rules and reports, Emergent builds that app from a prompt, with the calendar in a database you own.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is social media automation software used for?\", \"a\": \"Mostly publishing: it posts each approved item at its slot and keeps the live link. Teams also use it to route drafts to reviewers and to pull reach numbers into a weekly summary. Apps built on Emergent carry no task cap, and a launch week with twice the usual volume runs like any other week.\"}, {\"q\": \"Can you use social media automation tools to write captions?\", \"a\": \"Yes, for first drafts. An AI step in the app can turn a product note into a caption once it has your brand voice and a few past posts that did well. Have a person read every draft and check any price or date against the source. To carry a draft through to an approved caption, set up a content workflow.\"}, {\"q\": \"Is it bad to automate your social media?\", \"a\": \"No, as long as the app handles the mechanics and people handle the voice. Publishing on time and counting results lose nothing when software does them. Keep comments and direct messages with a person, because followers notice a canned reply. Timely posts need a human check too: pause the queue when news breaks that could make a cheerful post look careless.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you automate social media posts for multiple accounts?\", \"a\": \"Add an account column to the calendar and authorize each account once. Every row then names the account it belongs to, and the app publishes to that one. Agencies usually give each client its own reviewer, with one person signing off for each brand. A filtered view per account lets that reviewer see only their own posts.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are examples of real estate social media automation?\", \"a\": \"Brokerages automate more than new-listing posts. A price-reduced post goes out when the list price drops, an open house reminder runs the morning before, and a sold-listing post follows each closing. Every post pulls photos and figures from the listing record, and the agent signs off through an approval workflow before anything runs.\"}, {\"q\": \"Are social media automation platforms safe to use?\", \"a\": \"Platforms that publish through official APIs are. Instagram's API posts to professional accounts and LinkedIn's Posts API to company pages. LinkedIn automation that comments or messages through bots or browser extensions breaks LinkedIn's rules and can get an account restricted. Emergent apps connect through the official APIs.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is the difference between social media marketing automation and scheduling?\", \"a\": \"Scheduling decides when a post goes out. Social media marketing automation covers the work around that moment: routing drafts for approval, recycling posts that performed, and tagging the people who click a campaign link. Those clicks can feed <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-automation-builder/sales-automation'>sales automation</a> when a lead is ready for a rep.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
